/-!
# The middle 32 fixed J₂ coordinate polynomials

This module proves vanishing for exactly rows 28–59 of the unchanged
numerical relation list, covering pairs (1,7) through (4,6). Sparse tables
share all required binary prefixes within each pair. The final bridge gives
the same equations for the actual coordinate operators and seed.

Equality of the full numerical list with `Certificate.relations` is an
independent obligation owned by the presentation assembly.

Source: `Presentation/source/README.md` and the unchanged
`complete-pair-certificates.json`. Generated by `PolynomialsB/source/generate.py`;
all numerical witnesses are checked by Lean's kernel.
-/


